  <purpose>Group-level enterprise architecture of VIO Group, a FICTIONAL multinational tour operator. Maintained by Group Enterprise Architecture. It describes the group view only: source-market systems and many integration details are known to other teams and live in their own sources (C4, Backstage, LeanIX, BPMN).</purpose>
</archimate:model>
